    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pinnacle Point</i>, Aron is on a desperate mission to search for his lost brother who got tangled up with a sinister corporation that claims to offer a solution for immortality. As he infiltrates their ranks, he uncovers a horrifying truth: their version of eternal life comes at a great cost. Aron must navigate this treacherous world, risking his own soul, to save his brother from a fate worse than death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.poster.avif?t=1754641627\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.webm?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.mp4?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being worked on. Gameplay, screenshots and trailers might change. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay with Modern elements:</strong>\u00a0Navigate the eerie island with a blend of exploration, puzzle-solving, and strategic combat. Resources are scarce, and encounters with the grotesque inhabitants is a tense, life-or-death struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0The game employs a cinematic blend of dynamic and fixed camera angles, enhancing the suspenseful, immersive experience. Dense fog, flickering lights, and unsettling sounds keep you constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Discover the island\u2019s dark secrets through cryptic notes, fragmented memories, and environmental cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong>\u00a0The line between reality and nightmare blurs as you delve deeper into the corporation\u2019s experiments and your brother\u2019s fate. Voice acting and meticulously crafted environments build a world steeped in atmospheric horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.poster.avif?t=1754641627\" width=610 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.webm?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.mp4?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE AUTHOR:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pinnacle Point is a passion project from me, Robin Shen, the solo developer behind Ready2Run Games.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 15+ years working as a software developer, I\u2019ve channeled my love for storytelling and technology into creating games. <i>Pinnacle Point</i> is my biggest project yet, combining psychological horror, survival elements, and a deeply personal narrative that explores memory, self-discovery, and fear.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pinnacle Point</i>, Aron is on a desperate mission to search for his lost brother who got tangled up with a sinister corporation that claims to offer a solution for immortality. As he infiltrates their ranks, he uncovers a horrifying truth: their version of eternal life comes at a great cost. Aron must navigate this treacherous world, risking his own soul, to save his brother from a fate worse than death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.poster.avif?t=1754641627\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.webm?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.mp4?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being worked on. Gameplay, screenshots and trailers might change. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay with Modern elements:</strong>\u00a0Navigate the eerie island with a blend of exploration, puzzle-solving, and strategic combat. Resources are scarce, and encounters with the grotesque inhabitants is a tense, life-or-death struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0The game employs a cinematic blend of dynamic and fixed camera angles, enhancing the suspenseful, immersive experience. Dense fog, flickering lights, and unsettling sounds keep you constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Discover the island\u2019s dark secrets through cryptic notes, fragmented memories, and environmental cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong>\u00a0The line between reality and nightmare blurs as you delve deeper into the corporation\u2019s experiments and your brother\u2019s fate. Voice acting and meticulously crafted environments build a world steeped in atmospheric horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.poster.avif?t=1754641627\" width=610 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.webm?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.mp4?t=1754641627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE AUTHOR:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pinnacle Point is a passion project from me, Robin Shen, the solo developer behind Ready2Run Games.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 15+ years working as a software developer, I\u2019ve channeled my love for storytelling and technology into creating games. <i>Pinnacle Point</i> is my biggest project yet, combining psychological horror, survival elements, and a deeply personal narrative that explores memory, self-discovery, and fear.</p>",
    "short_description": "You must uncover the truth that lured your brother into a corporation's twisted promise of a better life. Finding yourself on an isolated island, you'll fight to survive, solve mysteries, and confront a past better left forgotten. A dark, 1990s-inspired modern psychological horror awaits.",
